{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And Balaam answered, etc., saying.</b> One needs to understand the verse's saying <b>לֵאמֹר</b> — for to whom would he say it to Balak? Rather, the intention is to say that what he had spoken to him before, his intent was to tell him that whatever HaShem speaks — whether curse or blessing — that I will do. If so, then even without receiving instruction, if HaShem speaks to bless them I will bless them, to fulfill the word of HaShem."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:13:30.344118268Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}